                                uccakarmma A prayojayet || 12.11 ||

akṣais taiḥ samaṃ japyā japyā] A; japyāḥ S śatrūṇāṃ
                                prāṇanāśanam prāṇanāśanam] em.; prāṇanāśanāt A;
                                pāpanāśanam S || 12.19 ||

anyavarṇo 'prakṛṣṭās anyavarṇo 'prakṛṣṭās] em.; anyavarṇo
                                prakṛṣṭās S; anyavarṇāprakṛṣṭās A tu • adhamāś adhamāś] A;
                                adharmaś S caiva varjitā |

vividhāni puṣpajātāni puṣpajātāni] em.; puṣpajātīni S
                            tathānyāṃ gandham āśritām tathānyān gandham āśritān] em.;
                                tathānyāṃ gandham āśritām S |

vaśitā sarvakalpānāṃ svāmī svāmī] conj. (based on the Tib.);
                                °ścamī S • ekākṣaro mahān mahān] em.; mahām
                                S |

yatrastha yatrastha] em. (on the authority of the Tib.);
                                tatrastho S ātmadehasthaḥ ātmadehasthaḥ] em.;
                                mātmadehastho S paśyec paśyec] em.; paśye
                                S caiva yatra vai || 15.10 ||

tā na sevet sevet] em.; seve S tadā mantrī na
                                siddhyarthā na siddhyarthā] conj. (based on the Tib.);
                                bhidyarthā (unmetrical) S tu varṇitaḥ |

ahīnāṅgo 'tha sarvatra dūrva dūrva°] em. (on the authority of
                                the Tib.); pūrva° Sśyāmo mahaujasaḥ || 15.116 || {S155}
                            {V116}

tena mantrabalam mantrabalaṃ] em. (on the authority of the
                                Tib.); mantravarṇa S tasya bhagnāsau namucis bhagnāsau
                                namucis] em.; balāsau bhagnāśau namuciṃs (hypermetrical) S tadā || 17.24 || {V130}

tei:div.p:
atha bhaga­vāñ śākya­munir grahāṇāṃ caritaṃ sarvasattvārthaṃ
                            sarvasattvārthaṃ] R; sarvaṃ sattvārthaṃ S vakṣye vakṣye]
                                em.; vakṣe] R; vahe° S | hitārthaṃ hitārthaṃ] R;
                            °kārthaṃ S sarvajāpināṃ mantrārthaṃ ca prasādhitam prasādhitum] R;
                            prasādhitam S + + + + + + + + The lacuna is only in S.
                        vakṣye sarvaṃ sa sarvavit || 24.3 ||

