                                    em.; bṛhaspategraham īkṣite S; vṛhaspate grahamī*te A; vṛhaspatigraham īkṣate R || 24.60 ||
                                {S269}
                            {A37r}

tīvro vijitasaṅgrāmo vijitasaṅgrāmo] em.; vijitasaṅgrāmaḥ S;
                                vijīvati saṃgrāma° A; varjjitasaṃgrāma° R rājāsau {R6v} bhavate dhruvam || 24.88
                            ||

