                                S nakṣatreṣu narādhipām narādhipām] S; narādhipāṃ A;
                                narādhipāḥ R || 24.135 ||

mahāmāryo mahāmāryo] S, A; mahāvyāryo R ca sattvānāṃ durbhikṣaṃ
                                rāṣṭrabhedanaṃ durbhikṣaṃ rāṣṭrabhedanam] A, R;
                                durbhikṣarāṣṭrabhedane S |

jvarārogaśūlais jvarārogaśūlais] S; jvarāro ** ** śūlais A;
                                jvarārocakakarṇaśūlais R tu vyādhibhiḥ vyādhibhiḥ] S; vyādhi°
                                A, R sphoṭakais tathā tathā] R; sadā S; ++ dā A |

saṃvejayanti saṃvejayanti] em.; saṃvejayati S, R;
                                saṃvedayanti A bhūtāni deśād deśe gamaṃ deśād deśe gamaṃ] R;
                                deśād deśāgamaṃ S; deśoddeśataman A tadā tadā] A, R; tathā
                                S || 24.164 ||

sitavarṇās sitavarṇas] em.; sitavarṇṇas R; s+tavarṇṇas A;
                                sitavarṇās S tathā nityaṃ praśastaḥ śubhadas tathā tathā] A,
                                R; tadā S |

somo 'pi varadaś caivakīrtyate ca śubhapradaḥ | somo 'pi varadaś caiva] S;
                                    om. A • ity ete dvādaśā lakṣaṇāḥ lakṣaṇāḥ]
