                                parikalpitam parikalpitam] em.; parikalpitaṃ A, R;
                                patikalpitam S |

tei:div.p:
tato dvitīye prahare • ekāgramanāḥ paryaṅkaṃ baddhvā • aṅkuśaṃ gandhapuṣpadhūpair {S293}
                        abhyarcya kṛtarakṣaḥ | sarvabuddhabodhisattvān namaskṛtya • aṅkuśaṃ hastena gṛhya tāvaj japed yāvad atrāntare narakāyikānāṃ
                        devānāṃ vedanāny upaśāmyante | sarvabuddhabodhisattvān namaskṛtya utpatati | vidyādhararājo 'pratihatagatir aṅkuśavyagrahastaḥ | sarvadevanāgayakṣādayaś ca dṛṣṭvā dūrād eva praṇāmaṃ kurvanti | kalpasthāyī yadā mriyate tadā vajrabhavanaṃ gacchati | vajrapāṇiṃ paśyati || 26.23 ||

yatkāraṇaṃ mahāpuṇyābhivṛddhaye mantrāṇāṃ tathāgatānāṃ saṃjñāparikīrtanaṃ namaskāraṃ ca sarvatathāgatānāṃ ca
                            praṇāmaṃ praṇāmaṃ] em. (on the authority of the Tib.);
                            pramāṇaṃ S niyataṃ bodhiparāyaṇo 'yaṃ kuśalasambhāraparipūrito bhavati | bodhi­sattvasaṅkhyaṃ gacchati | mantrā ca
                        tasya āśu siddhiṃ prayacchanti || 27.5 || {S302}

saṃkṣepataḥ sarvatathāgatoṣṇīṣarājānaṃ mahā­cakra­vartinam ekākṣarasya ca yāni kalpavistarāṇi • uktāni tāni sarvāṇi
                        karoti | asādhito 'pi japtamātraḥ karmāṇi kurute | kaḥ punarvādaḥ sādhitaḥ | yatheṣṭaphalasampadāṃ dadāti | īpsitaṃ bhavati
                        manasā yad abhirucitam asya paṭasya darśanād eva | niyataṃ bodhiparāyaṇo bhavati || 27.43 || {S306}

kuśaviṇḍakopaviṣṭas tatraiva śrāntaḥ sarvabuddhānusmṛtiṃ bhāvayet | manasā jāpaṃ kuryāt | anyatra vivikte
                        kuśasaṃstare śayyāṃ kalpayet | atipānam atibhojanam atiparyaṭanam atidarśanam atiśayyāṃ ca varjayet | triḥkālaṃ buddhānusmṛti
                        bhāvayet | śukrabandhaṃ ca kuryāt | śobhanāni ca svapnāni nānyasya prakāśayet | bhagavato nivedayet || 28.7 || {V243}

pūrvoktena vidhānena • anāhate paṭe keśāpagate • ārya­mañjuśrīḥ kumara­bhūtaḥ • ābhilekhyaḥ sarvālaṅkāravibhūṣitaḥ | raktavarṇaḥ kumārarūpī padmāsanasthaḥ | dakṣiṇapārśve • aryāvalokiteśvaro vāmapārśve samanta­bhadraḥ | ārya­mañjuśriyasya
                        kiñcid ūnau | taṃ paṭaṃ sthāpayitvā koṭiṃ japet | rājā bhavati | candanasamidhānāṃ kuṅkumābhyaktānāṃ lakṣaṃ juhuyāt | rājā
                        bhavati | agarusamidhānāṃ dadhimadhughṛtāktānāṃ lakṣaṃ juhuyāt | rājā bhavati | jātīkusumānāṃ ghṛtāktānāṃ koṭiṃ juhuyāt | rājā
                        bhavati || 28.24 || {S316}
                        {V245}

upoṣadhikena śuklapratipadam ārabhya śrīvāsakadhūpaṃ madhumiśraṃ juhuyāt | rājyaṃ labhate | koṭiṃ japet mañjuśriyaṃ
                        svayam eva paśyati dharmadeśanāṃ ca karoti | yadi kenacit sahollāpayati sammukham avabhāsate avabhāsate] em.; avabhāṣate S | avaivartikaś ca bodhisattvo bhavati ||
                        tṛtīyaṃ vidhānam || 28.32 || {V246}

tasyaiva paṭasyāgrataḥ kapilāyāḥ samānavatsāyāḥ goghṛtaṃ gṛhya tāmrabhājane sthāpya tāvaj japed yāvad ūṣmāyati | dhūmāyati | prajvalati | ūṣmāyamānaṃ pītvā paramamedhāvī bhavati śrutidharaḥ | dhūmāyamāne 'ntardhānam | jvalamāne •
                        ākāśagamanam | āmaśarāvasampuṭe sthāpya {S319} vacāṃ jātī­kusumair veṣṭayitvā tāvaj japed yāvad
                        aṅkurībhavati | tāṃ bhakṣayitvā śrutidharo bhavati | anyāṃ koṭiṃ japet mañjuśriyaṃ sākṣāt paśyati dharmadeśanāṃ ca śṛṇoti | tāñ tāñ] em.; tāṃ S cādhimucyate || 28.39 || {V247}

tasya vāmena • āryāvalokiteśvaraḥ padmahastaś cāmaravyagrahastaḥ | dakṣiṇena • ārya­samanta­bhadraḥ • upari
                        meghagarbhavinirgatau vidyādharau mālādhāriṇau likhāpayitavyau | adhastāt sādhako dhūpakaṭacchakavyagrahastaḥ | samantāt
                        parvataśikharā likhāpayitavyāḥ likhāpayitavyāḥ] A; likhāpayitavyā S | adhastāt padmasaraḥ || 29.7 || {S323}

kapilāyāḥ samānavatsāyāḥ • ghṛtaṃ gṛhya tāmrabhājane sthāpya
                            tāmrabhājane sthāpya] A; tāmrabhājanaṃ S saptabhir aśvatthapattrair avaṣṭabhya avaṣṭabhya] em.; avaṣṭasya A; sthāpya S tāvaj japed yāvat trividhā
                        siddhir iti | taṃ pītvā śrutidhara-m-antardhānākāśagamanam iti || 29.13 || {S324}

lg.l:
sādhake yuktim āyuñjet āyuñjet] em.; āyuñje S • na
                                sādhyaṃ sādhyaṃ] em. (on the authority of the Tib.);
                                sārdhaṃ S karma na vidyate || 34.21 ||

ubhayor aṅguṣṭhayor aṅguṣṭhayor] em.; aṅguṣṭhayon° S
                            miśraḥ sthāpayet sthitakaṃ sadā | {S365}
                            {V284}

tei:div.p:
tā eva pradeśinyau paratas tulyam udyamya • āśleṣya madhyamasūcye tejorāśimudrā | mantraṃ cātra bhavati | oṁ
                        tathāgatoṣṇīṣa • anavalokitamūrdhni tejorāśi hūṃ jvala jvala eka eka dara vidara cchinda bhinda hūṃ hūṃ sphaṭ sphaṭ svāhā
                        || 37.12 || {V321}

kṛtāñjalivinyastau vinyastau] em. (on the authority of
                            the Tib.); vidhinyastau S hastau śobhanākārasaṃsthitau sarveṣāṃ rūpādhacarāṇāṃ {V325}
                        devānāṃ mudrā bhavati | tad eva hastau • ārupyādhacarāṇāṃ devānāṃ mudrā bhavati || 37.61 ||

evaṃ rājakule • ekākṣararājagandhabodhi­sattvahṛdayena evaṃ tenaiva mudrāyā maṇikule yakṣakule divye • ārye | teṣv
                        iha • ekākṣarahṛdayais teṣv eva mudraiḥ sarvakarmāṇi kartavyāni | evaṃ sarvatra sarvamudraiḥ sarvamantraiś ca sarvakarmāṇi
                        kartavyāni | yathāyuktitaḥ vidyāmantrabalādhānā nyaset | nānyataḥ karmāṇi kartavyāni || 37.72 || {V326}

ime 'ṣṭānuśaṃsā śrāddhasyāvicikitsato 'bhiyuktasya draṣṭavyāḥ | gṛhiṇo gṛhiṇo] em.; gṛheṇo S vā pravrajitasya vā striyasya vā puruṣasya vā
                        mahā­sattvānāṃ śāsanopakāriṇāṃ nānyeṣām | pāpakarmapravṛttānāṃ viparyastam adhastād bhavati {S427}
                        rauravādiṣu || 37.114 ||

yad uktaṃ śucineti astaṃ gate bhānoḥ snāyīta śucinā jalena niḥprāṇakena pratyagrāmbaranivāsī • uṣṇīṣakṛtarakṣaḥ •
                        grāmyadharmavivarjī śucicaukṣarakṣarataḥ śubhaḥ śubhaḥ] em.;
                            śubha S || 37.117 ||

dīrghāyuṣo bhavati sarvakarmasamarthaḥ | mahāvyādhibhir mucyate | sarvajanapriyo bhavati | amitrāṇāṃ pratyaṅgiram
                        upajāyate | dṛṣṭamātrāś ca sarvagrahakravyādakaśmalādayaḥ prapalāyante | parabalaṃ stambhayati | darśanamātreṇaiva sarvakarmāṃ
                        karoti | śucināśucinā vidhānenāvidhānena • evam asya || 37.122 || {S428}

lg.l:
saddharmaratnasaṅghe ca pratikṣeptā pratikṣeptā] em.;
                                pratikṣeptavyāḥ (unmetrical) S 'samāhite 'samāhite]
                                    em. (on the authority of the Tib.); samāhite S |

mahāpakṣāṃ mahāpakṣāṃ] em. (on the authority of the Tib.);
                                mahāyakṣāṃ S, A balināṃ balināṃ] em.; valināṃ A;
                                dhanināṃ S krūrāṃ mahāsainyasamāśritām |

tei:div.p:
tathaiva bho jinaputrāsmābhiḥ śikṣitavyam | yad uta tv vinayanāya
                            vinayanāya] em.; avinayanāya S sattvapākānuśāsanāya ca | tatra bhavanto jinaputrāḥ • yo 'yaṃ
                        parṣanmaṇḍalamahāsamayopaviṣṭās tatra sarvaiḥ samagraiḥ śrotavyaṃ śraddhātavyaṃ ya eva kuśalākuśalagaveṣaṇair bhavitavyam | yad uta tathāgatadharmadeśanābhiratair bhavitavyam || 52.12 || {V438}

yadi na prāpnoti sparśanaṃ darśanapathe sthitā • adarśane vā • anuvāte ca bhasmam utsṛjed yathā tasya bhasmanā īṣid
                        avadhūlitaḥ | manasā ca cintayitvā dātā bhasmam utsṛjet | yat tena cintitaṃ bhavati tat sarvāṇi karmāṇi karoti parahastena vā
                        • ātmanā vā | yathābhilaṣitaṃ tat sarvāṇi karmāṇi karoti nānyathā cāvandhyaṃ bhavati || 52.30 || {V440}

āgatā ca kāmayitavyā | bhāryā bhavati sarvakāmadā | yady asau bhavanaṃ praviśate pañcavarṣasahasrāṇi jīvati | na ced
                        atraiva jambūdvīpe vicarati | pañcavarṣaśatāni jīvati | tayā sārdhaṃ krīḍati | sarvājñāṃ sampādayati | tena tena] S; tayā A saha yatreṣṭaṃ tatra gacchati | rasāyanam anuprayacchate | iṣṭabhāryeva hitā °eva hitā°] A; °evāvahitā° Sadhyāśayaṃ karoti
                        || 52.45 || {S566}

tataḥ paścāt sādhanam ārabhet | phalake vā paṭṭake vā kuḍyāyāṃ vā • aśleṣakair varṇakair navabhājana navabhājana°] S; nava° Akūrcakaiḥ | ādau tāvat parvatarājā sumerur
                        likhāpayitavyaḥ {V443} caturasraś catuḥśṛṅgocchṛtaḥ saptaparvatapaṅktipariveṣṭitaḥ | teṣāṃ
                        parvatānām ante guhaḥ parvataniḥśṛtaḥ • ālikhitavyam || 52.63 || {S568}

manojñāyā mantraḥ | oṁ manohare madonmādakari madonmādakari] S, A;
                            madotsavakari D vicitrarūpiṇi maithunāpriye svāhā | asyām upacāraḥ | udyānavāṭikāyām aśokavṛkṣasyādhastāt su su°] A; sa° Svibhaktāṃ kuṭiṃ kuṭiṃ] S; kuṭikāṃ A kārayitvā • suguptatarāṃ sugupta°] A; agupta° S kṛtakavāṭārgala °kavāṭārgala°] S; °kapāṭārgula° Aprākārocchritāṃ śucinā lakṣam ekaṃ japet
                        || 52.81 ||

surasundaryāyā mantraḥ | oṁ surasundari svāhā | asyām upacāraḥ | khadirakāṣṭhair agniṃ prajvālya ghṛtāhutīnām
                        aṣṭasahasraṃ juhuyāt trisandhyaṃ māsam ekam | tataḥ tataḥ] em.;
                            tata A; om. S śuklapūrṇamāsyāṃ kuśaviṇḍakopaviṣṭaḥ śucinā śucau deśe mantraṃ tāvaj japed rahasi yāvad
                        ardharātre niyatam āgacchati | tato mātā bhaginī bhāryā yathaiva pūrvaṃ tat sarvaṃ karoti | sarvaṃ ca vistarato vaktavyam
                        || 52.87 || {S572}

sarveṣāṃ saṃkṣepato yatrapratimā yatrapratimā] em.;
                            yatra pratimā S; the Tibetan text reflects the reading yantrapratimā. svayaṃ vā pratikṛtiṃ kṛtvā krodharājānaṃ yamāntakaṃ tāvaj japed yāvat pratibimbaṃ
                        prakampya pracalate prasvidyati vā | ayaṃ svarūpeṇāgacchante | yad ucyante
                            ucyante] A; ucyate S tat sarvaṃ sampādayante sampādayante] S;
                            sampādayati A || 52.116 || {V448}

lg.l:
ākṛṣṭā vaśitā vaśitā] em. (on the authority of the Tib.);
                                vasitā S, A ghoro ghoro] em.; ghorā A; ghīrā
                                S durdāntadamakaḥ prabhuḥ || 52.139 ||

mahāsāhasralokānāṃ dhātvādhyān dhātvādhyān] em.; dhātvādhyām°
                                S; dhātvātmyān Y acittakān acittakān] em.;
                                acittakām S || 53.53 ||

mahāyaśaiḥ śrāvakaiś cāpi prajñā prajñā°] Y; prājñaḥ
                                Sdhūrdharatāṃ °dhūrdharatāṃ] em.; dhūrdharatāṃ S;
                                °dhurandharatāṃ Y gataiḥ |

tataḥ prāṇātyaye nṛpaḥ nṛpaḥ] conj.; nṛpatau (unmetrical)
                                S svargaloke jagāma saḥ jagāma saḥ] em.;
                                jajagmasu (unmetrical) S |

bhāguptaḥ bhāguptaḥ] S; bhūguptaḥ Y vatsakaś caiva bhāsvāṃś
                                caiva bhāsvāṃś caiva (conj.) Y; om.
                                S paścimaḥ | {S622}

ity ete nṛpatayaḥ sarve kathitā vimukhās vimukhās] em.;
                                vipukhas S tathā kathitā vipukhas tathā] S; kāñcipure sthitāḥ
                                Y |

nānāmlecchagaṇādhyakṣāḥ gaṇādhyakṣāḥ] em.; gaṇādhyakṣā S;
                                gaṇarājānaḥ (reconstructed based on the Tib.) Y śāstupūjana
                                °pūjana°] Y; °pūjaka° Statparāḥ |

vāṇaijeyas tu vāṇaijeyas tu] em.; vāṇyājeyas tus S; brahmā
                                vai tadā Y tadā saiva dṛṣṭvā tu saṃmukhaṃ saṃmukhaṃ] Y;
                                saṃmukhāṃ S munim || 53.599 || {S630}

kārāṃś kārāṃś] S; vidyā Y ca śreyasīṃ yuktāṃ
                                bodhimārgopayojanīm bodhimārgopayojanīm] (reconstructed based on the
                                Tib.) Y; bodhimārgaviyojanīm S || 53.611 || {S631}

so 'py 'vahata 'vahata°] em.; vahata Y; atahata°
                            Svidhvasta ripubhiḥ samantāvṛtaḥ samantāvṛtaḥ] em.;
                                samatā vṛtaḥ S; samaṃtād vṛtaḥ Y |

kṛpī bhogī 'pramādī bhogī 'pramādī] em.; bhogī pramādī S;
                                amitabhogī Y ca saṃrājā saṃrājā] em.; saṃ rājā S;
                                sa rājā Y dharma­vatsalaḥ |

tatra tatra] Y; tatrau S ca kṣatriyo bālaḥ • vaṇijā ca
                                sahāgataḥ vaṇijā ca sahāgataḥ] (reconstructed based on the Tib.);
                                vaṇinā ca tathāgataḥ S |

antime ca antime ca] (reconstructed based on the Tib.) Y; om.
                                S tadā janme bandhaṃ chetsyati chetsyati] em.;
                                setsyati S sarvadā || 53.742 ||

śāsanārthaṃ kariṣyanti mantravāde mantravāde] em.;
                                mantravāda° S sadā ratāḥ ratāḥ] em.; ratā
                                S || 53.855 || {S651}

tadyathā mātṛceṭākhyaḥ mātṛceṭākhyaḥ (reconstructed based on the Tib.) Y;
                                mātṛcīnākhya S kusumākhyaś kusumākhyaś] Y; kusumārākhyaś
                                (unmetrical) S ca viśrutaḥ |

prasannaḥ prasannaḥ] em. (on the authority of the Tib.);
                                prasanne S śāsane hy agro agro] S; agre Y mantrajāpī hi
                            vai bhuvi || 53.890 ||

visaraṃ kalpaṃ mantrāṇāṃ kalpaṃ mantrāṇāṃ] em.;
                                kalpamantrāṇāṃ S karma • āyūṃṣi āyūṃṣi] em.;
                                āyūṣi S bhūnṛṇām |

śrāddho 'vimati 'vimati] em. (on the authority of the Tib.);
                                vimati S sandehavigato sandehavigato] em.;
                                sandehaḥ vigato S dharma­vatsalaḥ || 54.50 ||

tei:div.p:
samanantarabhāṣiteyaṃ mantrā kumara­bhūtena mañjuśriyeṇa bodhisattvena mahā­sattvena | iyaṃ mahāpṛthivī ṣaḍvikāraṃ
                        prakampitā saśailasāgaraparyantā sarvāṃś ca buddhāṃ bhagavatāṃ kṣetrānantāparyantā saloka­dhātudiśaparyantām | sarvaiś ca
                        buddhair bhagavadbhir adhiṣṭhitāni ca • imāni mantrapadāni || 54.65 || {S663}

lg.l:
analānilam analānilam] em. (on the authority of the Tib.);
                                anilaṃ nilam S ākāśaṃ śūnyatvasubhāṣitam ˚subhāṣitam]
                                    em. (on the authority of the Tib.); ˚subhāvitam S |

note.p:
Acts for which one will be reborn in hell immediately after death, without any intervening stages;
                                they include killing one’s mother, father, or an arhat, causing a dissention in the saṅgha, and causing the blood of a
                                tathāgata to flow. The term is also written in this translation as the “five karmas of immediate retribution.”
